      "content": "let go? i don't know if that's even possible. it feels like if i stop for even a second, everything just collapses. i feel like i'm just a burden to everyone around me, constantly needing help or just being a zombie. i'm so sick of the constant struggle to just... exist. does it ever actually get better, or is this just how it is forever?",
